{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_2001_p", "source_sha256": "8a0bd8e74486032bb84ef5e675ae9ad8b0cb92e7689b445b91200e03dd95b859", "ja": "（今日の仕事は旅番組だ。撮影前に\n温泉街を見て回ることになったが……）", "zh": "（今天的工作是旅游节目，\n我们决定在拍摄前先到温泉街逛一圈……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_2002_048rei", "source_sha256": "655e1f82070255bbd76d09eccfcc5e0b1ccb0473dca4b8daaf6b6b15ac6b160e", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nお仕事のあと、少し寄り道していいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n工作结束后，回程路上可以绕点远路吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_2003_p", "source_sha256": "02917ade1371a1941136224b1c8ca558516b710a9f7aebccb85b8315f98b455c", "ja": "寄り道？", "zh": "绕远路？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_2004_048rei", "source_sha256": "4c33e2ed44b6811ec5c06e76cef452ecce519e6133cb338c7ba6e5dd1ad0de4f", "ja": "はい！　あそこにある山に、登ってみたくて。\n一緒に「やっほー」って叫びにいきましょう♪", "zh": "是的！我想去爬那边的山，\n我们一起去大喊「呀呵──」吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5cf075ad5fe7d331c1784c132a4c32a73c4239b48ffb504be4a558e46bafeec2", "ja": "山登りか……天気もいいし、気持ち良さそうだな。\nよし、撮影が早く終わったら、寄ってみようか。", "zh": "爬山啊……今天天气也不错，感觉会很舒畅呢。\n好，要是拍摄可以早点结束，就绕过去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_2006_048rei", "source_sha256": "ad9b4aad226d6b7862395bc6fdde0f183bed5312b7c6d02da38e60311bc36da9", "ja": "わーい！　私、お仕事じゃんじゃか頑張りますね♪\nファイトで、ゴーゴー♪", "zh": "哇～！我会努力迅速完成工作的♪\nFight，Go Go～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
